# Snowslope Hunter: "Sacrifice another creature or artifact: Exile the top card of your library. You may play it until the
# end of your next turn. Activate only during your turn and only once each turn." Turn 1: Bot1 sacrifices a Mox Jet (an artifact
# that is not a creature) and exiles its Forest; a second activation the same turn is not offered although a Goblin Assailant
# and Moxen are there to sacrifice. It is not offered on the opponent's turn 2 either. Turn 3: it is offered again, the Assailant
# (a creature that is not an artifact) pays and exiles the Plains, and the Forest is played from exile as the turn's land
# drop. Turn 5: the Plains, exiled on turn 3, is played from exile.

